**Total for the year: €2,120**, which is **about €706.67 each** for Sam, Priya and Tom.

Your list has Feb 198 twice. I treated that as a copy-paste duplicate and counted February once, so the 12 months add up to €2,120. If you really were billed twice in February, the total is €2,318 and the split is about €772.67 each.

Since 2,120 doesn't divide evenly by 3, two people pay €706.67 and one pays €706.66 if you want it to the cent.
